# Admission Form UI Project

This is a simple student admission form webpage with validation, countdown timer,
animation and responsive UI. Made using HTML, CSS and JavaScript only.

## Features
✔ Animated UI / UX  
✔ Form Input Validation  
✔ Countdown Timer  
✔ Mobile Friendly  

## How to Use
1. Open `index.html` in any browser.
2. Fill the form and submit.

